  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Areas v2.0",
    "description": "The dataset consists of health area boundaries with name, location, health zone, and attributes for eleven provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. The current version supersedes GRID3 COD - Health Areas v1.0 (https://doi.org/10.7916/v2bv-4h83). This current version includes the province of Kasaï-Central. Keywords: health areas, health zones",
